  "group_defs": {
    "fm-operator-pair": {
      "name": "FM Operator Pair",
      "description": "Two-operator FM synthesis: a modulator sine bends the phase of a carrier sine, adding sidebands that brighten the tone the harder it pushes, from a pure sine through mellow and brassy to bell-like and clangorous. It is a body for a Voices node: tick **Polyphonic** on its Node tab to make it one and wire MIDI into its `midi` input to play it.\n\n- `ratio` is the modulator's frequency as a multiple of the note's. Whole numbers (1, 2, 3) give harmonic tones; others (1.41, 3.5) give metallic, bell-like ones.\n- `index` is how hard the modulator pushes, in radians of phase: 0 is a pure sine, 1 to 3 warm to bright, 5 and up harsh. Each sideband's level follows the Bessel functions of the index, as in any FM synth.\n- `mod_attack`, `mod_decay`, and `mod_release` (seconds) and `mod_sustain` (0 to 1) shape the index over each note: the modulator's envelope. A fast decay to a low sustain makes notes start bright and mellow out, like a struck or plucked sound; a slow attack makes them bloom.\n- `attack`, `decay`, `release`, and `sustain` shape the volume: the carrier's envelope.\n- `level` (dB) is the voice's loudness, and each note's velocity scales it. The voices of a Voices node add up, so turn it down for big chords.\n- `out` is the voice, mono.\n\nInside: a Voice node gives the note's frequency, gate, and velocity. The modulator Oscillator runs at the frequency times `ratio`. `index` divided by 2π (radians to cycles), times the modulator's ADSR, sets how far its output swings, and that goes into the carrier Oscillator's `phase` input. This is phase modulation, which gives the same spectrum as frequency modulation but keeps the pitch steady however deep it goes. The carrier, at the note's frequency, passes through a VCA (a Math multiply) driven by its own ADSR times velocity, then a Gain for `level`.",
      "version": 1,
      "author": "Audio Constructor",
      "tags": [
        "synth",
        "instrument",
        "fm",
        "polyphonic",
        "bell"
      ],
      "source": "shipped:fm-operator-pair",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "ratio",
          "type": "float",
          "unit": "ratio",
          "default": 1.0,
          "range": [
            0.25,
            16.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "2:b"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "index",
          "type": "float",
          "default": 2.5,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            20.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "3:a"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "attack",
          "type": "float",
          "unit": "seconds",
          "default": 0.005,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            10.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "9:attack"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "decay",
          "type": "float",
          "unit": "seconds",
          "default": 1.0,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            10.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "9:decay"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "sustain",
          "type": "float",
          "default": 0.6,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            1.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "9:sustain"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "release",
          "type": "float",
          "unit": "seconds",
          "default": 0.4,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            20.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "9:release"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "mod_attack",
          "type": "float",
          "unit": "seconds",
          "default": 0.005,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            10.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "5:attack"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "mod_decay",
          "type": "float",
          "unit": "seconds",
          "default": 0.5,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            10.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "5:decay"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "mod_sustain",
          "type": "float",
          "default": 0.3,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            1.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "5:sustain"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "mod_release",
          "type": "float",
          "unit": "seconds",
          "default": 0.4,
          "range": [
            0.0,
            20.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "5:release"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "level",
          "type": "float",
          "unit": "db",
          "default": -6.0,
          "range": [
            -60.0,
            12.0
          ],
          "targets": [
            "c:gain"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "out",
          "type": "audio",
          "source": "c:out"
        }
      ],
      "graph": {
        "nodes": [
